    "reason": "D085 adds repair_feedback.owner_alternatives owner-probability-v1 check_error_repair generation-direct-v1 and owner_tiebreak flat-reask-v2 (its second owner question) (with its local diagnosis callback) as opt-in manifest bindings in adaptive-dag-runner.mjs, and points the gate default at v11. The Jev request format, prompt policy and connection rules are unchanged. Pins frozen on 2026-10-14. v1-v10 are unchanged. Re-frozen 2026-10-18 on feat/heldout-eval-20261018 (R20261017-EVAL-PROTOCOL held-out): adaptive-dag-runner.mjs binds a non-openapi input to its own public registry and derives its public test count; the v1 cohort check accepts an unlimited v3/v4 ledger so a held-out catalog can be prepared; opt-in manifest key partial_repair: local-readiness-v1 enables the R20261015 partial readiness repair. openapi manifests keep the registry.v4 rule."
  },
